      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "The “Big Three” in China’s Food Service"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "无论你走在中国的哪个省哪个市哪个区哪个镇，",
      "traditional": "無論你走在中國的哪個省哪個市哪個區哪個鎮，",
      "pinyin": "wú lùn nǐ zǒu zài zhōng guó de nǎ ge shěng nǎ ge shì nǎ ge qū nǎ ge zhèn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "几乎在每一条街上都能找到大小不一的餐饮店。",
      "traditional": "幾乎在每一條街上都能找到大小不一的餐飲店。",
      "pinyin": "jī hū zài měi yì tiáo jiē shang dōu néng zhǎo dào dà xiǎo bù yī de cān yǐn diàn",
      "english": "No matter which town, district, city or province you go in China, .."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小一点的叫饭馆，大一点的叫饭店，",
      "traditional": "小一點的叫飯館，大一點的叫飯店，",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo yì diǎn de jiào fàn guǎn dà yì diǎn de jiào fàn diàn",
      "english": ".. almost every street is scattered with restaurants of different scales."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "干净现代一点的叫餐厅，豪华一点的那就是酒店了，",
      "traditional": "乾淨現代一點的叫餐廳，豪華一點的那就是酒店了，",
      "pinyin": "gān jìng xiàn dài yì diǎn de jiào cān tīng háo huá yì diǎn de nà jiù shì jiǔ diàn le",
      "english": "The small ones are called fàn guǎn; the bigger ones are called fàn diàn;"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "不过酒店也常常是宾馆，进去之前你可要看清楚了。",
      "traditional": "不過酒店也常常是賓館，進去之前你可要看清楚了。",
      "pinyin": "bú guò jiǔ diàn yě cháng cháng shì bīn guǎn jìn qù zhī qián nǐ kě yào kàn qīng chu le",
      "english": "The cleaner and more modern ones are called cān tīng; the fancy ones are jiǔ diàn."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "但是目前垄断中国乡镇大街小巷餐饮行业的是以下这“三巨头”，",
      "traditional": "但是目前壟斷中國鄉鎮大街小巷餐飲行業的是以下這“三巨頭”，",
      "pinyin": "dàn shì mù qián lǒng duàn zhōng guó xiāng zhèn dà jiē xiǎo xiàng cān yǐn háng yè de shì yǐ xià zhè sān jù tóu",
      "english": "Jiǔ diàn could also be hotels so you need to look into this before you get in."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "它们是兰州拉面（也是很多人口中的清真餐厅），沙县小吃和桂林米粉。",
      "traditional": "它們是蘭州拉麵（也是很多人口中的清真餐廳），沙縣小吃和桂林米粉。",
      "pinyin": "tā men shì lán zhōu lā miàn yě shì hěn duō rén kǒu zhōng de qīng zhēn cān tīng shā xiàn xiǎo chī hé guì lín mǐ fěn",
      "english": "However, at present the “Big Three” in China’s food service, dominating towns and cities, are the following:"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "这些都是草根饭馆，既方便又廉价，是平民百姓最经常去的。",
      "traditional": "這些都是草根飯館，既方便又廉價，是平民百姓最經常去的。",
      "pinyin": "zhè xiē dōu shì cǎo gēn fàn guǎn jì fāng biàn yòu lián jià shì píng mín bǎi xìng zuì jīng cháng qù de",
      "english": "Lanzhou Lamian (a.k.a. the muslim place), Shaxian Snacks and Guilin Mifen."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "They are everyday restaurants, convenient and cheap, enjoying great popularity among the public."
    }
  ],
